Package: CompreSSoR
Type: Package
Title: Compressed GWAS Summary Statistics
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: person("Fergus", "Hamilton", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "fh6520@users.noreply.github.com")
Author: Fergus Hamilton [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Fergus Hamilton <fh6520@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Convert prepared genome-wide association study summary statistics
    into a compact, block-indexed Pcodec store with a self-contained GRCh37 or
    GRCh38 variant identity key and semantic Z/EAF/SE encoding. The core
    validates explicit REF/ALT, effect/non-effect allele, beta and standard
    error fields but performs no reference lookup, allele harmonisation or
    liftover. P-values and beta are reconstructed on demand; Parquet remains
    available as an interoperability backend.
URL: https://github.com/gushamilton/CompreSSoR
BugReports: https://github.com/gushamilton/CompreSSoR/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
